  "$comment": "Finishing a half-typed name, shared by tests/shared/completion.test.ts and the Android CompletionTest. The two clients complete differently on purpose \u2014 the desktop cycles with Tab, the phone offers a row to tap \u2014 but not about the answer. They differed: the phone put a colon after anything completed at the start of a line, including a channel, so tapping #switchboard gave '#switchboard: '.",
